{"v":4,"catch":"一次又一次的激動！ 喘不過氣來！ 戰鬥，CHARLIE！","desc":"“CIRCUS CHARLIE”是1984年由“ KONAMI”發行的滾動動作遊戲。\n玩家控制馬戲團小丑查理（CHARLIE）進行大膽的馬戲團表演，例如跳過火圈和空中飛人。\n用您的完美表演使觀眾眼花！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2020-08-06","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e8fbb8b25559a904e97c6d527dcff042ee8d50a9b209ae86fdd8d12614f16312.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c13cf57af85d89314c398be63468a163f4728103e03f1ee795defa4b6912ad30.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/60f7ecd005619cc74a6223983da05a0766656cd3c910173061b24fd03510b7fb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/45a01cb857b13537f6391c733bb5d36f985a4cc287ea81ceaa2f884f7dbda8fd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a6fea0e9efd665d13cd9afeeafca45766430a0948d8949eecb77814896cd0d99.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/14c832592208c5221cf8f8adbb117ea50880683bb3e001026a95c027344adfe6.jpg"],"titleId":"0100557012752000","dlc":[]}